EPITA PIE kit                github.com/KazeTachinuu/epita-ing1-setup

compile
  cc99 main.c                 moulinette flags (-std=c99 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -pedantic -g3)
  ccsan main.c                same + ASAN/UBSAN
  cctest test.c str.c         criterion suite -> ./a.out
  cccov test.c str.c          same + coverage report -> coverage/index.html
style
  clang-format -i *.c         apply the graded style (vim formats C on save)
  coding-style-check .        style linter: 54 rules clang-format cannot check
submit
  submit tagname              clean-tree + format gate, annotated tag, push --follow-tags
  gp                          git push --follow-tags
search
  rg word                     grep the repo
  fd name                     find files
  Ctrl-R                      fuzzy history
  Ctrl-T / Alt-C              fuzzy file insert / fuzzy cd
vim
  Ctrl-N                      file tree
  Space m / n / p             make / next / prev error
  gd gr K Space r             definition, references, docs, rename
  main<Tab>                   snippet; Tab jumps placeholders
  :Termdebug ./a.out          gdb in vim
gdb
  gdb ./a.out                 GEF loads if installed
  valgrind ./a.out            on a cc99 build (ASAN and valgrind conflict)
tmux
  tmux                        mouse on, vi copy mode

i3 (stock, identical on exams)
  Super+Enter / Super+d       terminal / launcher
  Super+1..9                  workspaces
  Super+Shift+q               close window
  i3lock                      lock when you leave (white screen = locked, not frozen)

exams: no AFS, kit tools absent; memorize vimrc.exam (3 lines)
